      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>During travel one of the possible discoveries is that of a vista. A breathtaking locale or solemn monument. In short, they are memorable places of your party's journey.</p><p>When encountering one, the players are incentivized to take the lead in describing it and how it fits with the setting.</p><p>If one of the players decides to contribute art for it, they get bonus points! You will want to save it in your <em>album.</em></p>"
